 "description": "Fetch one RentCast record for a US street address. kind=property: characteristics, owner, last sale, tax bill, assessment, HOA and sale history. kind=value: automated value estimate with a low/high range and the sale comps behind it. kind=rent: long-term rent estimate with a range and rental comps. One upstream call per lookup; use realestate_deal_memo when you need all three plus the underwriting. Returns {data, sources, as_of, confidence, notice}. Paid: $0.10 per call; without credit you get a PAYMENT_REQUIRED result. Set sample=true for a free example response.",
